00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.087
Waktumu sudah lama berakhir.

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.760
Sang Bodhisattva?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.879
Apakah ini Bodhisattva
yang dibicarakan Fan Xiao?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.760
Aku sangat marah.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.520
Hei, jelaskan lebih lanjut.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:59.729
Bagaimana tepatnya Direktur You memukulimu?

00:18:59.729 --> 00:19:01.029
Persetan denganmu.

00:19:01.029 --> 00:19:03.400
Fan Xiao, cukup sudah.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.839
Apakah dia tampan?

00:19:04.839 --> 00:19:05.880
Ya!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.439
Sangat tampan!

00:19:07.439 --> 00:19:08.680
Lalu kenapa?

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.760
You Shu Lang punya pacar.

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.560
